<title>USA: National Media knows no reason for stock activity.</title>
<headline>National Media knows no reason for stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Media Corp knows of no reason for the activity in its stock on Monday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Shares in National Media, a direct marketer of consumer products through television, rose 1-1/8, or more than 16 percent, to eight. Volume at mid-afternoon was 577,000 shares, or more than three times normal daily trade.</p>
<p>&quot;Obviously someone is accumulating a lot of stock,&quot; spokesman Bruce Boyle told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no news ... and no news pending that would be responsible for this kind of activity.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
